  "question": {
    "html": "<p>When a transverse wave travels through a medium, which of the following is true about the direction of propagation and the energy transfer of the wave in relation to the displacement of the medium?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of propagation</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of energy transfer</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Perpendicular</td>\n<td>Parallel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Parallel</td>\n<td>Parallel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Parallel</td>\n<td>Perpendicular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Perpendicular</td>\n<td>Perpendicular</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
